  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The Planetary-Governor of the Commonwealth of Jupiter.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"List_of_Planetary-Governors\">List of Planetary-Governors</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fsecond-renaissance.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FPlanetary-Governor_of_Jupiter%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"margin:0px; font-size:90%;\"><span style=\"border:1px solid #AAAAAA; background-color:#FFA500; color:black;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span>&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/Conservative_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Conservative Party (United States)\">Conservative</a></span> (2)\n<span style=\"margin:0px; font-size:90%;\"><span style=\"border:1px solid #AAAAAA; background-color:#1E90FF; color:black;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span>&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/United_Republican_Party_(United_States)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"United Republican Party (United States)\">New Republican</a></span> (1)\n<span style=\"margin:0px; font-size:90%;\"><span style=\"border:1px solid #AAAAAA; background-color:#062A78; color:black;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span>&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/Union_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Union Party (United States)\">Union</a></span> (2)\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>№\n</th>\n<th colspan=\"2\">Planetary-Governor\n</th>\n<th>State\n</th>\n<th>Term of office\n</th>\n<th>Party\n</th>\n<th>Term<br /><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-num&#95;1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-num-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>n 1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</th>\n<th style=\"width: 18%;\" colspan=\"2\">Lieutenant-Governor\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"background: #062A78;\"><span style=\"color:white\">1</span>\n</th>\n<td><div class=\"\">\n<div style=\"width: 100px; height: 125px; overflow: hidden;\">\n<div style=\"position: relative; top: -2px; left: -7px; width: 110px\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/6/6d/Blank_Person.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20150810222433\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Blank_Person.jpg\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/6/6d/Blank_Person.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/110?cb=20150810222433\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"110\" height=\"134\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Blank Person.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Blank_Person.jpg\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></a></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td>\n<td><b>Jeriel Cortes</b><br /><small>(born 1999)</small>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Earth\" title=\"Earth\">Cascadia</a>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"date\" style=\"white-space: nowrap;\">January 20, 2139</span><br />–<br /><span class=\"date\" style=\"white-space: nowrap;\">January 20, 2143</span><br />\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Union_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Union Party (United States)\">Union</a>\n</td>\n<td>1<br /><small>(2138)</small>\n</td>\n<td style=\"background: #062A78;\">\n</td>\n<td>Andrew Pham\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"background: #062A78;\"><span style=\"color:white\">2</span>\n</th>\n<td><div class=\"\">\n<div style=\"width: 100px; height: 125px; overflow: hidden;\">\n<div style=\"position: relative; top: -3px; left: -5px; width: 110px\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/4/40/Blank_Woman.png/revision/latest?cb=20151107015223\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Blank_Woman.png\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/4/40/Blank_Woman.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/110?cb=20151107015223\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"110\" height=\"134\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Blank Woman.png\" data-image-key=\"Blank_Woman.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td>\n<td><b>Nica Rowan</b><br /><small>(born 2042)</small>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Jupiter\" title=\"Jupiter\">Galileo</a>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"date\" style=\"white-space: nowrap;\">January 20, 2143</span><br />–<br /><span class=\"date\" style=\"white-space: nowrap;\">January 20, 2147</span><br /><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-unseated&#95;2-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-unseated-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>n 2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Union_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Union Party (United States)\">Union</a>\n</td>\n<td>2<br /><small>(2142)</small>\n</td>\n<td style=\"background: #062A78;\">\n</td>\n<td>Sydney Riler\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"background: #FFA500;\"><span style=\"color:white\">3</span>\n</th>\n<td><div class=\"\">\n<div style=\"width: 100px; height: 125px; overflow: hidden;\">\n<div style=\"position: relative; top: -3px; left: -5px; width: 110px\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/4/40/Blank_Woman.png/revision/latest?cb=20151107015223\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Blank_Woman.png\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/4/40/Blank_Woman.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/110?cb=20151107015223\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"110\" height=\"134\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Blank Woman.png\" data-image-key=\"Blank_Woman.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td>\n<td><b>Emile Yang</b><br /><small>(born 2080)</small>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Jupiter\" title=\"Jupiter\">Galileo</a>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"date\" style=\"white-space: nowrap;\">January 20, 2147</span><br />–<br /><span class=\"date\" style=\"white-space: nowrap;\">January 20, 2151</span><br /><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-unseated&#95;2-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-unseated-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>n 2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Conservative_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Conservative Party (United States)\">Conservative</a>\n</td>\n<td>3<br /><small>(2146)</small>\n</td>\n<td style=\"background: #FFA500;\">\n</td>\n<td>Philly Gates\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th rowspan=\"2\" style=\"background: #1E90FF;\"><span style=\"color:white\">4</span>\n</th>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><div class=\"\">\n<div style=\"width: 100px; height: 125px; overflow: hidden;\">\n<div style=\"position: relative; top: -2px; left: -7px; width: 110px\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/6/6d/Blank_Person.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20150810222433\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Blank_Person.jpg\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"110\" height=\"134\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Blank Person.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Blank_Person.jpg\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/6/6d/Blank_Person.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/110?cb=20150810222433\" /></a></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"width: 16%;\"><b>Buzz Belfast</b><br /><small>(born 2093)</small>\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/wiki/Jupiter\" title=\"Jupiter\">Valhalla</a>\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><span class=\"date\" style=\"white-space: nowrap;\">January 20, 2151</span><br />–<br /><span class=\"date\" style=\"white-space: nowrap;\">January 20, 2159</span>\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/wiki/United_Republican_Party_(United_States)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"United Republican Party (United States)\">New Republican</a>\n</td>\n<td>4<br /><small>(2150)</small>\n</td>\n<td style=\"background: #8CBED6;\">&#160;\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">David Andruzzi\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5<br /><small>(2154)</small>\n</td>\n<td style=\"background: #1E90FF;\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th rowspan=\"2\" style=\"background: #FFA500;\"><span style=\"color:white\">5</span>\n</th>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><div class=\"\">\n<div style=\"width: 100px; height: 125px; overflow: hidden;\">\n<div style=\"position: relative; top: -2px; left: -7px; width: 110px\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/4/40/Blank_Woman.png/revision/latest?cb=20151107015223\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Blank_Woman.png\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"110\" height=\"134\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Blank Woman.png\" data-image-key=\"Blank_Woman.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/4/40/Blank_Woman.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/110?cb=20151107015223\" /></a></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><b>Mika Sakahki</b><br /><small>(born 2119)</small>\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/wiki/Jupiter\" title=\"Jupiter\">Galileo</a>\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><span class=\"date\" style=\"white-space: nowrap;\">January 20, 2159</span><br />–<br /><span class=\"date\" style=\"white-space: nowrap;\">Present</span>\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/wiki/Conservative_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Conservative Party (United States)\">Conservative</a>\n</td>\n<td>6<br /><small>(2158)</small>\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"background: #FFA500;\">\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">Abram Inoki\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br /><span class=\"error mw-ext-cite-error\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">Cite error: <code>&lt;ref&gt;</code> tags exist for a group named \"n\", but no corresponding <code>&lt;references group=\"n\"/&gt;</code> tag was found</span>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261119205948\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.053 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.072 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 407/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 3192/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 553/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 631/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   36.602      1 -total\n 28.69%   10.503      3 Template:Legend2\n 15.42%    5.643      3 Template:CSS_image_crop\n  9.54%    3.493      2 Template:Css_Image_Crop\n  9.40%    3.440      5 Template:Union_Party_(United_States)/meta/color\n  6.02%    2.204      5 Template:Conservative_Party_(United_States)/meta/color\n  5.69%    2.083      5 Template:Color\n  5.17%    1.891      1 Template:Liberal_Party_(United_States)/meta/color\n  4.67%    1.710      3 Template:United_Republican_Party_(United_States)/meta/color\n  3.84%    1.406      5 Template:Ifnumber\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.10_prod_secondrenaissance:pcache:idhash:3333-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20261119205948 and revision id 10061. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>",
